invariant: INV-64
file: srv_mldsa.c
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the server signs its CertificateVerify content under a one-byte
  context, where draft-ietf-tls-mldsa fixes an empty one, so every client
  refuses the signature. ch_srv_check verifies the boot signature with the
  empty context, and test_identity_and_cpu requires it to pass.

--- old
        mldsa87_sign(sig, id->priv, id->priv_len, id->pub, id->pub_len, content, n, NULL, 0, rnd);
--- new
        mldsa87_sign(sig, id->priv, id->priv_len, id->pub, id->pub_len, content, n,
                     (const uint8_t *)"x", 1, rnd);
